      "findings": "TikTok @morco11111, 5-29: thanks brand for taking packaging as seriously as formulas; 1 like. Perceived packaging care, not comparative performance verification or buying behavior. SKU/version unknown."
    },
    {
      "key": "P40",
      "findings": "TikTok @danaisabellaaa, 5-15: 'it’s SOOOO CUTE'; 1 like. Terse aesthetic approval in packaging discussion; precise referent/SKU unresolved, with no experience detail or buying consequence."
    },
    {
      "key": "P42",
      "findings": "TikTok @__whitneyjade, 5-20: received theirs that day and only then discovered refillability; 1 like. Reported receipt and excitement at refillability, not a refill purchase or evidence refillability motivated acquisition. SKU/version unknown."
    }
